00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:19.720
Everybody wants to
innovate quickly.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.030
There's a lot of data.

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:22.610
The data volume is growing.

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:25.610
So the choice or
the option is not

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:29.630
to keep all your data
stored on premise.

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:32.900
Cloud has a lot of benefits
