00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:12.390
That's what this part of
the product helps with.

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:15.480
And I think I also heard
control over there, so this

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.820
is where the second part of--

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:20.670
