00:17:16.869 --> 00:17:18.720
so we have this
concept of unions

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.990
that we have coined
with Data Custodian.

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:23.880
The concept of union is a
geolocation defined area

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:29.670
